Recursive leaf extract:
```python
def leaves(obj, prefix=""):
    out={}
    if isinstance(obj, dict):
        for k,v in obj.items():
            p=f"{prefix}.{k}" if prefix else str(k)
            out.update(leaves(v,p))
    elif isinstance(obj, list):
        for i,v in enumerate(obj):
            p=f"{prefix}[{i}]"
            out.update(leaves(v,p))
    else:
        out[prefix]=norm(obj)
    return out
```

